@startuml
!theme materia

<style>
document {
  BackgroundColor transparent
  `materia wants Verdana, which isn't installed
  FontName sans-serif
}
</style>

title
  =External IDP
  ==Stroom is the Relying Party and runs the code flow itself
end title

actor "User\n(browser)" as browser
participant "Stroom" as stroom
participant "Identity provider" as idp

== Signing in ==

browser -> stroom: GET /
stroom --> browser: Bootstrap page
browser -> stroom: GET /api/auth/flow/v1/status
stroom -> stroom: No session, and no verified\ncredential on the request
stroom --> browser: 200 {authenticated: false, redirectUrl}\nSets the state and target cookies
note right of stroom
  The state binds the flow to this
  browser and carries the nonce
  and the PKCE code verifier
end note

browser -> idp: GET //authorization endpoint//\nclient_id, redirect_uri, state,\nnonce, code_challenge (S256)
idp --> browser: Sign in prompt
browser -> idp: Credentials
idp --> browser: 302 to the redirect_uri\nwith an authorization code

browser -> stroom: GET /api/auth/flow/v1/signin-oidc\ncode, state
stroom -> stroom: The state must match\nthe cookie set above
stroom -> idp: POST //token endpoint//\ncode, code_verifier,\nclient_id, clientSecret
idp --> stroom: ID token and access token
stroom -> idp: GET //jwks_uri// (cached)
idp --> stroom: Signing keys
stroom -> stroom: Verify signature, issuer,\naudience and nonce.\nMap uniqueIdentityClaim\nto a Stroom user
stroom --> browser: 302 to the original page,\nsets the session cookie

== Afterwards ==

browser -> stroom: GET /api/... (session cookie)
stroom --> browser: Response

@enduml
